<title>USA: National Insurance to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>National Insurance to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH SAN FRANCISCO 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Insurance Group said that it may from time to time repurchase up to 700,000 shares of its common stock, or about 15 percent of its common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>It said the repurchase of shares will be dependent on market conditions and there are no assurances as to the exact number to be repurchased.</p>
<p>It said it considered the shares an attractive investment.</p>
</text>
